      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Sufferers of osteoarthritis are all too aware of the daily pain and impairment of swollen joints, of having to give up sports-and jobs-due to cartilage defects. What they may be less aware of is that three-dimensional (3-D) bioprinting and bioink technologies are being developed to revolutionize the existing (and often imperfect) treatments available to them."},
